\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Singapore \highlight\uc2  Dlr Up On Yuan, Off High;Suspected  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 534 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Juli 2005\par 09:31\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SINGAPORE\b0 \highlight\uc2  (Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar rose against its U.S. counterpart in Asia late Friday, reacting to China's revaluation of the yuan overnight, but shed some of its early gains on suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Government bonds ended lower, tracking overnight losses in U.S. Treasurys after China's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  appreciation was deemed bearish for the bond market.  \par \par \uc2 At 0656 GMT, the U.S. dollar was at S$1.6609, down from S$1.6804 late Thursday. The U.S. unit dipped to S$1.6511 very early, but suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the MAS helped it to recover to S$1.6609 in late trade.  \par \par \uc2 Late Thursday, the People's Bank of China announced the yuan's de facto peg to the dollar would be dropped in favor of a managed float against a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . In the process, the yuan will initially be revalued about 2% to CNY8.1100 to a dollar from CNY8.2765.  \par \par \uc2 The MAS, which also held a news conference Friday to release the bank's annual report for the financial year, didn't confirm if it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 But MAS Deputy Managing Director Ong Chong Tee said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will only \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar breaches its trade-weighted exchange rate band.  \par \par \uc2 "We will only come in when the trade-weighted index has breached its policy band and if market conditions are volatile," he said.  \par \par \uc2 Ong said the local dollar is currently in the "upper half" of its trade-weighted band.  \par \par \uc2 While the MAS won't release the actual band, United Overseas Bank says the band is currently S$1.6217-S$1.6878 with the midpoint at S$1.6548.  \par \par \uc2 The MAS reiterated Friday that its Singapore dollar policy stance of modest and gradual appreciation remains appropriate.  \par \par \uc2 Nevertheless, traders said the Singapore dollar will continue to face speculative pressure to appreciate because players will use the local unit as a proxy for more revaluation in the Malaysian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 The Malaysian ringgit rose only 0.4% Friday after its \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  disbanded the ringgit-dollar peg, which was below market expectations of around 3% appreciation.  \par \par \uc2 In the government bond market, the 10-year government bond yield rose to 2.69% from 2.66% while the two-year yield was little changed at 2.02% from 2%.  \par \par \uc2 The yields tracked the selloff in U.S. Treasurys, which was sparked by fears that inflation could rise in the months ahead in the context of higher prices of goods being imported from China into the U.S.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                         Latest     Previous \par    Overnight rate       1.8750%    1.8750% \par    Two-year bond yield  2.02%      2.00% \par    10-year bond yield   2.69%      2.66% \par    Two-year swap offer  2.16%      2.16% \par    10-year swap offer   2.88%      2.86% \par    2-10-yr swap spread: 72 BPs     70 BPs \par  \par    Historical bond yields and final prices can be viewed at the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Singapore's bond Web site: \par  \par     \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.sgs.gov.sg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.sgs.gov.sg }}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Saeed Azhar, Dow Jones Newswires; 65-6415-4157; saeed.azhar@dowjones.com  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -Edited by Mary de Wet [ 22-07-05 0731GMT ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 1163 1859  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050722e17m000bq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
